\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Eternal depth of love divine,
\par In Jesus, God with us, displayed;
\par How bright Thy beaming glories shine!
\par How wide Thy healing streams are spread!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. With whom dost Thou delight to dwell?
\par Sinners, a vile and thankless race:
\par O God, what tongue aright can tell
\par How vast Thy love, how great Thy grace!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. The dictates of Thy sovereign will
\par With joy our grateful hearts receive:
\par All Thy delight in us fulfil;
\par Lo! all we are to Thee we give.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. To Thy sure love, Thy tender care,
\par Our flesh, soul, spirit, we resign:
\par O fix Thy sacred presence there,
\par And seal the abode for ever Thine!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. O King of Glory, Thy rich grace
\par Our feeble thought surpasses far;
\par Yea, even our sins, though numberless,
\par Less numerous than Thy mercies are.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Still, Lord Thy saving health display,
\par And arm our souls with heavenly zeal,
\par So fearless shall we urge our way
\par Through all the powers of earth and hell.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

